<%-
  base_url = "/rnode/#{host}/#{port}/#{password}"
-%>
<p>
  Juicebox runs in your browser. This session shares
  <code><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(data_dir) %></code> with it, read-only.
</p>

<a href="<%= base_url %>/ood/files.html" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank">
  <i class="fas fa-folder-open"></i> Browse files
</a>
<a href="<%= base_url %>/" class="btn btn-outline-primary" target="_blank">
  <i class="fas fa-th"></i> Open Juicebox
</a>

<p class="small text-muted mt-2">
  Use <em>Browse files</em> to open a <code>.hic</code> map directly, or to copy the URL of a
  track or second map for Juicebox's <em>Load ... &gt; URL</em> menus. Links only work while
  this session is running, and anyone you send one to can read the shared directory until
  the session ends.
</p>
